      "id": 12,
      "title": "🔍 API Gateway P95 — Per Endpoint (Drill-down)",
      "description": "P95 latency tách theo từng endpoint. Dùng để debug SLO chính xác hơn so với panel aggregate bên trên.\n\n• GET /products: cache hit → rất nhanh (~10-30ms)\n• GET /orders: DB query (~80-150ms)\n• POST /order: bao gồm payment call → có 20% slow gateway (~1.5-2s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(api_gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{endpoint=\"/products\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "GET /products P95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(api_gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{endpoint=\"/orders\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "GET /orders P95"
        },
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(api_gateway_request_duration_seconds_bucket{endpoint=\"/order\"}[5m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "POST /order P95"
        }
      ]
